      "created_at": "2012-10-05T20:35:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can't ignore the smaller damage to wait for the bigger damage. \"First time\" means first time, similarly to how Wraith's damage reduction innate blows everything you've stacked up the next time you take damage, even if it's only a plink.</p>",
