      "created_at": "2012-11-04T15:48:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry to revive</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>but does \"first\" trigger on every instance of damage?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>so if I hit with an attack with multiple instances (eg.: damage written on multiple lines, or multiple types of damage), the \"first each turn\" condition only triggers on the first instance, or is it on the card as a whole?</p>",
